  title="A free Tella alternative for Mac"
  answer="Reelbird is a free, open-source Tella alternative for the Mac. Like Tella, it zooms automatically, adds captions and gives you a link to share. Unlike Tella, which has no free plan and costs $13 or $19 per user a month billed yearly, Reelbird is free, copies the link the moment you stop, keeps every take as MP4 files on your Mac and hosts links in your own bucket or on Reelbird Pro for $5 a month. Tella is the better pick for teams that edit in the browser and work on Windows too."
  verdict="Reelbird vs Tella in one line: Tella is a hosted team workspace for polished walkthroughs; Reelbird is a free Mac recorder that gives you the link first and the polish later."
  rival="tella"
  datePublished="2026-11-07"
  rows={[
    ["Price", "Free, MIT licensed. Optional Reelbird Pro, $5 a month, hosts your links", "Pro $13 and Premium $19 per user a month, billed yearly"],
